flowchart TD
  subgraph Receipt[Physical receipt and shelf preparation]
    Truck[Actual package remains aboard truck] --> Reserve[Reserve compatible fixture space + netkg + access]
    Reserve -->|existing ready fixture| Pickup[Real worker pickup]
    Reserve -->|free suitable floor slot| Visit[Reserve actual Hauling worker / walk to service point]
    Visit --> Clear[Slot clear of other people]
    Clear --> Puff[Reused smoke / commit fixture ready]
    Puff --> Pickup
    Reserve -->|no feasible space| Hold[Keep cargo aboard / above-truck warning]
    Hold -->|actual capacity / route / fixture / staffing event| Reserve
    Pickup --> Carry[Actual carry / reserved destination retained]
    Carry --> Deposit[IdentityLedger real deposit once]
    Deposit --> Occupied[Commit package space / release reservation]
    Occupied --> Outgoing[Actual factory or construction pickup]
    Outgoing -->|real space freed| Reserve
  end
  subgraph Expansion[Paid physical expansion]
    Place[Grid placement] --> Gap{Matching warehouse edge?}
    Gap -->|no| Space[Require 2m ordinary footprint separation]
    Gap -->|yes| Adjacent[Allow touching / reserve unfinished module]
    Adjacent --> Build[Existing F03 construction / no new usable capacity yet]
    Build --> Complete[Actual completion]
    Complete --> Join[Open shared wall / connect walkable floor and lights]
    Join --> Slots[Add finite slots / preserve existing stock IDs]
    Slots --> Reserve
  end
  subgraph View[Keyed presentation]
    Occupied --> Signal[Warehouse state changed]
    Puff --> Signal
    Hold --> Signal
    Join --> Signal
    Signal --> Visual[Shelves / package labels / open walls / truck warning]
    Entry[Player Area3D entered or exited] --> Roof[Interior visibility / roof cutaway]
  end
